flowchart TD
  A["输入文本并提交"] --> B["im.send"]
  B --> C["Venus/C++ JSON stringify 或 host observation"]
  C --> D["`im_send_message`"]
  D --> E["Helix V1 Tick/Effect 路径"]
  E --> F["`POST /api/cses/posts/create` body `{viewers,message,mentions,temporaryId,type,simpleMessage,channelId,userId,teamId,userSnapshot,id,props,topicId,revoke,createAt,replyId?,replyRootId?,replyFirstLevelId?}`；`replied={id,reply_id,reply_root_id,reply_first_level_id}` 只在 Helix 组装回复三锚，`req_id` 只透传 `Cses-Track-Id`，两者均不作为 HTTP body 字段"]
  F --> G["正常发送主推 `post`；`update_channel` 不是普通发送主链路单独推送，仅在读标记/频道变更/撤回最后一条/加急等副链出现；错误本地 `im:post:send-failed`"]
  G --> H["批量 raw DomainEvent 回调 C++"]
  H --> I["Venus owning-thread tick / MobileImSdk legacy reducer"]
  I --> J["JS/C++ 重建：同一消息行从 sending 收敛为 sent 或 failed，禁止 JS 再造第二条临时消息"]
  E -. "Persist/HTTP/WS 失败" .-> X["raw failure event 或 SOURCE_MISSING"]
  X --> I
